config BT_SERVICE_MUSE_SETUP
    bool "Muse gadget setup service"
    depends on BT_SERVICE_AUDIO_COMPANION
    help
      Host Meta's Muse gadget BLE setup service for a short pairing window,
      on a second, private connection from a random static address, so the
      Muse app on the phone the watch is already connected to can pair the
      companion app as a Muse gadget. Allows two connections. Needs a public
      identity address. Off by default.
